{
  "id": "65f2d2544a9d810025366f87",
  "title": "炭鉱のカナリア",
  "created": 1710412374,
  "updated": 1794004230,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "65f2d2544a9d810025366f87",
      "text": "炭鉱のカナリア",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1710412374,
      "updated": 1710412374
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d256774b170000e23fa2",
      "text": "と同じ意味でXXの[イドバタニシ]としたい。何？[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1710412374,
      "updated": 1710412394
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9dc000000000059557a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972701,
      "updated": 1793972701
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9dc000000000059557b",
      "text": "https://dic.pixiv.net/a/炭鉱のカナリア",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972701,
      "updated": 1793972701
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d256774b170000e23fa3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1710412374,
      "updated": 1710412374
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee54140000000000cf098b",
      "text": "カナリア以外の動物の記述がある",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794003988,
      "updated": 1794004021
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee540f0000000000cf0989",
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentinel_species",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794003983,
      "updated": 1794003986
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee540f0000000000cf098a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794003983,
      "updated": 1794003983
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2925e90c00000105f7d",
      "text": "案",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412431,
      "updated": 1710412442
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2935e90c00000105f7e",
      "text": " 濁流のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412431,
      "updated": 1710412442
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d29b5e90c00000105f80",
      "text": " 泥中のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412439,
      "updated": 1710412455
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2ab5e90c00000105f81",
      "text": " 澱みのイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412455,
      "updated": 1710412469
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2b95e90c00000105f82",
      "text": " 毒沼のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412469,
      "updated": 1710412477
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2d15e90c00000105f83",
      "text": " 底なし沼のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710412493,
      "updated": 1710412499
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d2935e90c00000105f7f",
      "text": "　商会のイドバタニシ（shokaiさんのツイートを見て勝手に機能を試すの意）",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1710412432,
      "updated": 1710412738
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381f35e90c00000c07dc0",
      "text": "　夢の島のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710457332,
      "updated": 1710457337
    },
    {
      "id": "65f382555e90c00000c07dc1",
      "text": "　石灰鉱のイドバタニシ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710457430,
      "updated": 1710457443
    },
    {
      "id": "65f2d3ab774b170000e23fa5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1710412716,
      "updated": 1710412716
    },
    {
      "id": "65f3813a5729c00000ab0279",
      "text": "がんばって考えたけど思いつかず[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1710457148,
      "updated": 1710457155
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381415729c00000ab027c",
      "text": "\tタニシのイメージに濾過があるから、「イドバタニシの濾過」という単語は思いつく",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1710457155,
      "updated": 1710457218
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381805729c00000ab027d",
      "text": "\t炭鉱のカナリアが[毒ガス]の兆候、事前に察知に対して意味が違うことになるけど、イドバタニシによって澱んでいた何かが濾過（整理とかされて見えるようになる）といった事後に良い形になるような意味",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1710457218,
      "updated": 1793960870
    },
    {
      "id": "65f3813c5729c00000ab027a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1710457150,
      "updated": 1710457150
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381cb5e90c00000c07dbd",
      "text": " イドバタニシの酷使[cFQ2f7LRuLYP.icon]",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710457292,
      "updated": 1710457299
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381d65e90c00000c07dbf",
      "text": "  大事に酷使しよう",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710457303,
      "updated": 1710457317
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddab00000000000595597",
      "text": " \tイドバタニシの犠牲[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972913,
      "updated": 1793972914
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddab90000000000595598",
      "text": " \t\tイドバタニシは[犠牲になったのだ…]犠牲の犠牲にな…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972921,
      "updated": 1793972921
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedda800000000000595594",
      "text": "  \t炭鉱のカナリアのように、より耐性の低いイドバタニシが率先して犠牲になることで問題が発覚する事案",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972864,
      "updated": 1793972920
    },
    {
      "id": "65f381cd5e90c00000c07dbe",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1710457294,
      "updated": 1710457294
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed4e7d000000000011ff2c",
      "text": "\tすでに書いてるとおり[炭鉱]のガスをいち早く察知するための[カナリア]なので、As Sensorと考えるべきだろう[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793937022,
      "updated": 1793972841
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed4e90000000000011ff2e",
      "text": "\t\tイドバタニシはどういうセンサーとして使える？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793937042,
      "updated": 1793937056
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed4e9e000000000011ff2f",
      "text": "\t\tが、思いつかない、この方向は筋が悪そうだなー",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793937056,
      "updated": 1793937094
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed4ec5000000000011ff30",
      "text": "\t\tたぶん響きの美しさ？を優先した方がいい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793937094,
      "updated": 1793937107
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed4e7d000000000011ff2d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793937022,
      "updated": 1793937022
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed642700000000002a40fd",
      "text": " イドバタニシの憂鬱[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793942566,
      "updated": 1793942583
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed69b60000000000aa4392",
      "text": " \tイドバタニシの消失[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1793943990,
      "updated": 1793943994
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed643500000000002a40fe",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793942579,
      "updated": 1793942580
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed8603000000000036f67a",
      "text": "\t井戸端のイドバタニシ[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793951237,
      "updated": 1793951241
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed8608000000000036f67b",
      "text": "\t\t（そのまんますぎる）",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793951242,
      "updated": 1793951248
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedab84000000000073a592",
      "text": "\t井戸端西のイドバタニシ[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793960836,
      "updated": 1793960852
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed8603000000000036f679",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793951237,
      "updated": 1793951237
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9e3000000000059557c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972708,
      "updated": 1793972708
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedda1d0000000000595586",
      "text": " [\" タニシのイメージに濾過があるから、「イドバタニシの濾過」という単語は思いつく][. [炭鉱のカナリア#65f381415729c00000ab027c]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972766,
      "updated": 1793972808
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9e6000000000059557e",
      "text": " [\" イドバタニシはどういうセンサーとして使える？][. [炭鉱のカナリア#6aed4e90000000000011ff2e]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972710,
      "updated": 1793973041
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9f60000000000595584",
      "text": " \t毒物を摂取して犠牲になる感じの働きを探しているが、思い浮かばない…[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972727,
      "updated": 1793973256
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedde060000000000aff289",
      "text": " \t　犠牲から離れろ（セルフツッコミ）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793973766,
      "updated": 1793973779
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddb4c000000000059559a",
      "text": " \t[有機農業を科学する　～タニシでなぜ有機農業が可能になるのか解説～｜マイナビ農業 https://agri.mynavi.jp/2021_12_30_179926/#:~:text=タニシの働き%0A①土壌の改善（栄養、構造）%0A②多様な生物の発生を促進]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793973068,
      "updated": 1793973068
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9e4000000000059557d",
      "text": " \t> タニシの働き",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972708,
      "updated": 1793972812
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9eb0000000000595582",
      "text": "  > ①土壌の改善（栄養、構造）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972715,
      "updated": 1793972812
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedd9eb0000000000595583",
      "text": "  > ②多様な生物の発生を促進",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972715,
      "updated": 1793972812
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddafe0000000000595599",
      "text": "  \t> 【…】タニシはエサを土ごと食べて排せつするため、土壌をやわらかくするという構造面での改善をしてくれる。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972991,
      "updated": 1793973018
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddc25000000000059559b",
      "text": "   > 【…】栄養面での改善も見られる。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793973285,
      "updated": 1793973293
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeddc2d000000000059559c",
      "text": "   > 例えば稲が好むアンモニア態窒素は、タニシがいると土中の含有量が多くなるという。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793973293,
      "updated": 1793973293
    },
    {
      "id": "6aedda4e0000000000595587",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793972814,
      "updated": 1793972817
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee54470000000000cf098c",
      "text": "　イドバタニシのサクリファイス [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794004039,
      "updated": 1794004163
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee54480000000000cf098d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794004041,
      "updated": 1794004041
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee54f80000000000cf098e",
      "text": " [イドの怪物]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794004216,
      "updated": 1794004230
    },
    {
      "id": "6aee54f90000000000cf098f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794004217,
      "updated": 1794004217
    }
  ]
}